"Essam Al-Dardouri"...

00:06:27.566 --> 00:06:29.336
The message is nice, brother...

00:06:29.661 --> 00:06:32.550
May God grant victory to the
resistance and all its members, brother.

00:06:32.971 --> 00:06:36.794
May God make people
steadfast on the path, Allah willing.

00:06:37.912 --> 00:06:43.841
I swear, brother, I had a nice and
unusual feeling when I heard this message

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:50.889
