genuine credit that remains for humans.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:56.681
Prolonged audio-visual recordings
brought together Essam Al-Dardouri

00:06:56.983 --> 00:07:00.950
with a mysterious Lebanese
man called "Muhammad Ali Ismael",

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.579
who works for the Syrian regime.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.357
This leaked audio recording

00:07:05.616 --> 00:07:07.603
reveals contact between both men

00:07:07.989 --> 00:07:11.944
in order to secure an unofficial
rental of a number of Tunisian aircraft

00:07:12.524 --> 00:07:15.525
assisted by Essam Al-Dardouri's
relations in Tunisia.

00:07:16.326 --> 00:07:19.976
He said he wanted to
offer this project to you,

00:07:20.532 --> 00:07:24.270
and I told him that we don't
want anything for free. OK?

00:07:24.864 --> 00:07:29.901
If he can.. if we.. find someone

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:33.619
who can provide these planes
for domestic transportation.

00:07:35.012 --> 00:07:42.675
Does it mean he could make this company
signoff with us under the research he's done?

00:07:44.611 --> 00:07:47.861
The problem isn't about the
company's owner and who they are;

00:07:48.274 --> 00:07:53.897
the problem is that we couldn't find
anyone close to the company's owner so far.

00:07:54.397 --> 00:07:59.398
Because we don't want to go and discuss this matter
with him before guaranteeing his approval to help,

00:07:59.981 --> 00:08:01.401
that's the problem.

00:08:01.676 --> 00:08:03.874
I want that guy as soon as possible;

00:08:04.263 --> 00:08:08.880
we have a 24-hour to the 48-hour deadline.

00:08:09.388 --> 00:08:14.455
I requested my boss to give me
some time to sort this matter out,

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:15.579
do you get me?

00:08:15.947 --> 00:08:21.456
If I could reach an agreement, he'll call
them tomorrow or the day after and fix it,

00:08:21.829 --> 00:08:26.430
but now he's abroad, and I beseeched him
to allow me to intervene in this matter.

00:08:26.739 --> 00:08:28.698
So, both you and I  be benefited.

00:08:29.779 --> 00:08:34.459
Our friend, whom we met on some occasions, is a government
consultant, and he is at the Civil Aviation Authority.

00:08:34.888 --> 00:08:37.086
He has relations with people in the
Civil Aviation Council and the airports.

00:08:37.443 --> 00:08:39.634
So, he may be able to connect us with
the person we need within this context.

00:08:40.944 --> 00:08:44.508
The man that the recordings prove to
have a relation with Essam Al-Dardouri

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.844
is "Muhammad Ali Ismael".

00:08:47.312 --> 00:08:51.421
Who is known to some Tunisian security
services as Muhammad the Lebanese.

00:08:52.381 --> 00:08:56.060
In one of his televised interviews, the
former head of the Air Force Protection,

00:08:56.473 --> 00:08:59.913
Abdul Karim Al-Obeidi,
revealed his role.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:07.183
The Jihadist-Migration started in
2003 until 2017 and 2018—

00:09:07.452 --> 00:09:08.460
the Jihadist-Migration subject.

00:09:09.405 --> 00:09:13.294
I have also given a name of
a person called "Geovanni"

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:18.421
who is the head of Jihadist-Migration in the
whole wide world and north Africa.

00:09:18.675 --> 00:09:20.063
He was with a man called
"Muhammad the Lebanese".

00:09:20.643 --> 00:09:22.967
It was significant that
Abdul Karim Al-Obeidi

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:25.087
is one of the security figures

00:09:25.301 --> 00:09:28.896
who Essam Al-Dardouri
threw various accusations

00:09:29.253 --> 00:09:32.659
associating him with the Jihadist-Migration
matter currently being raised.

00:09:37.626 --> 00:09:39.759
There is a personal conflict

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:43.823
with representative Abdul Karim
Al-Obeidi and Ennahda Movement.

00:09:44.172 --> 00:09:47.843
It is tragic yet comic at the same time

00:09:48.375 --> 00:09:52.866
that Essam El Dardouri was accredited
as a primary witness in this case.

00:09:53.254 --> 00:09:57.040
This person doesn't have the characteristics
of a witness from the legal point of view.

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:59.134
He has no credibility whatsoever.

00:09:59.443 --> 00:10:06.935
Various incidents he
previously publically published

00:10:07.387 --> 00:10:09.159
that were proven to be untrue lately.

00:10:09.483 --> 00:10:12.095
Judicial sentences were
issued against him for it.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:18.845
Among the leaked recordings we
managed to get for Essam Al-Dardouri.

00:10:19.338 --> 00:10:20.532
An excitative recording.

00:10:20.849 --> 00:10:24.488
It has to do with Al-Dardouri
leaking sensitive security information,

00:10:24.766 --> 00:10:31.126
including a names-list of secret members
recruited by the Tunisian security abroad.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:36.218
Regarding the CD containing the pictures
of the members responsible for permeation

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:41.341
who have trained at the security units. Have
you checked them all? Do you have all of them?

00:10:41.976 --> 00:10:43.372
The recording? Is it working?

00:10:43.873 --> 00:10:51.452
Yes, everything you gave to me is
clear. Yet, I couldn't take the CD with me.

00:10:53.008 --> 00:10:54.746
So, I will try it in an alternative way.

00:10:55.856 --> 00:10:59.078
But, overall, all is
going well, Allah willing.

00:10:59.611 --> 00:11:05.812
Understood, brother; the recording, in particular, is
substantially important. It is very, very important.

00:11:06.288 --> 00:11:09.063
Specifically, it has
something big we can work on.

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:13.111
What disturbs me is that I have been
imprisoned because of this recording.

00:11:13.938 --> 00:11:17.875
The person speaking to me in the recording
is the Director General of National Security,

00:11:18.113 --> 00:11:19.591
Abdul Rahman Haj Ali.

00:11:20.043 --> 00:11:26.591
He is the one who filed a case against
me when he failed to get the recording.

00:11:26.972 --> 00:11:28.302
Thanks.

00:11:28.897 --> 00:11:32.246
The recording Al-Dardouri referred
to in his secret correspondence

00:11:32.812 --> 00:11:36.730
is a phone call between him and the former
Director General of National Security,

00:11:36.944 --> 00:11:38.484
Abdul Rahman Haj Ali.

00:11:38.934 --> 00:11:41.389
Which Al-Dardouri had leaked a part of,

00:11:41.783 --> 00:11:45.666
what provoked Abdul Rahman
Haj Ali to file a case against him,

00:11:45.928 --> 00:11:47.451
and he was sentenced to imprisonment.

00:11:47.729 --> 00:11:51.897
However, the verdict was appealed,
and the sentence was reduced to 4 months

00:11:52.204 --> 00:11:53.619
in 2017.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:55.821
Most importantly,

00:11:56.028 --> 00:12:01.099
is that these audio recordings confirm
the accusations raised against Al-Dardouri

00:12:01.559 --> 00:12:03.481
about communicating with foreign parties

00:12:03.783 --> 00:12:07.286
and leaking confidential
security information abroad.

00:12:08.659 --> 00:12:12.159
I contacted Essam
Al-Dardouri for an interview

00:12:12.646 --> 00:12:15.873
and to comment on the accusations
against him in this investigation.

00:12:19.285 --> 00:12:21.035
Peace be upon you, Mr Essam.

00:12:21.234 --> 00:12:24.345
- Mr. Essam Al-Dardouri?
- Al Jazeera? Welcome, Sir.

00:12:24.683 --> 00:12:25.905
We want to interview you

00:12:26.075 --> 00:12:29.444
regarding the issue of Jihadist-Migration,
the topic currently discussed

00:12:29.952 --> 00:12:33.183
in the Tunisian Judiciary.
If you have time.

00:12:34.429 --> 00:12:39.135
I beg your pardon, Sir.
I'm a primary witness in this case,

00:12:39.723 --> 00:12:44.294
and the case is still
considered confidential so far.

00:12:44.619 --> 00:12:48.312
This means that it's forbidden to
release any information about it legally.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:53.059
In this raised case, are you a witness
or, pardon me, an indicted Mr Essam?

00:12:53.353 --> 00:12:55.921
No! No! I am one of the
primary witnesses in this file.

00:12:56.143 --> 00:12:58.755
Because there was another case

00:12:58.954 --> 00:13:01.619
discussed some
accusations of you personally.

00:13:01.794 --> 00:13:05.294
What has been said about me is more
what Imam Malik has said about alcohol.

00:13:05.556 --> 00:13:07.492
The accusations are
returned on who made them up.

00:13:07.826 --> 00:13:11.944
Even concerning your
relationship with a Lebanese person

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:14.635
named "Muhammad Ismael",
has it been reopened...

00:13:14.889 --> 00:13:20.413
No! No! There haven't been any investigations
against me regarding this matter in any context.

00:13:20.937 --> 00:13:26.384
They were all false accusations. There is nothing
at all, and we have even appealed these issues.

00:13:27.407 --> 00:13:29.507
Got it, brother? You're welcome anytime.

00:13:29.709 --> 00:13:31.864
When it becomes no longer confidential,
and we can discuss it, I will.

00:13:32.158 --> 00:13:35.728
But I can't discuss anything confidential.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.848
Thank you for your time, Mr Essam.

00:13:39.324 --> 00:13:40.919
You are welcome.

00:13:41.246 --> 00:13:46.997
Despite Essam Al-Dardouri's promise of an
interview right after the legal approval,

00:13:47.362 --> 00:13:53.611
yet shortly after our call with him,
he wrote a post on his Facebook page

00:13:54.265 --> 00:13:57.468
attacking Al-Jazeera Channel
before broadcasting the investigation.

00:14:00.642 --> 00:14:02.897
These leaks of audio
recordings and other ones

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:07.175
made us wonder about the
actual role played by Al-Dardouri

00:14:07.681 --> 00:14:09.810
and to what extent he and others are used

00:14:10.221 --> 00:14:13.349
as tools serving hidden
agendas and interests.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.429
Their influence is still
present in the Tunisian scene

00:14:16.849 --> 00:14:18.134
since the outbreak of the revolution.

00:14:19.579 --> 00:14:20.619
In this investigation,

00:14:20.937 --> 00:14:25.198
we managed to obtain several private
and confidential files and documents

00:14:25.505 --> 00:14:29.802
investigating armed security
operations that took place in Tunisia.

00:14:30.227 --> 00:14:34.960
While scrutinising them, the name
Essam Al-Dardouri appears in one of them.

00:14:35.621 --> 00:14:37.684
In this leaked document,

00:14:38.042 --> 00:14:42.135
Essam Al-Dardouri files a complaint
against one of the public prosecutors,

00:14:42.397 --> 00:14:43.492
Hafeth Al-Obeidi

00:14:43.758 --> 00:14:48.936
accusing him of seducing and
assaulting an underage girl in 2016.

00:14:49.899 --> 00:14:52.429
Upon further scrutiny of the
identity of the Public Prosecutor,

00:14:52.938 --> 00:14:56.786
it turns out that this judge
was directly responsible

00:14:57.182 --> 00:15:04.881
for investigating the security operations
that rocked the country between 2015 and 2016.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:07.121
The most significant operations

00:15:07.462 --> 00:15:10.718
are the Mnihla operation
and the Bardo museum.

00:15:12.634 --> 00:15:14.515
It is noteworthy that
the aforementioned girl

00:15:14.857 --> 00:15:18.256
stated in the case records, according
to the documents we obtained,

00:15:18.603 --> 00:15:22.904
that Essam El-Dardouri had exploited
her as a permeation agent as she described,

00:15:23.198 --> 00:15:25.174
and she accused him of harassing her.

00:15:29.362 --> 00:15:32.770
Lotfi Brahem deliberately assigned

00:15:33.048 --> 00:15:35.683
the security unionist Essam Al-Dardouri

00:15:37.619 --> 00:15:42.937
to overthrow

00:15:45.357 --> 00:15:47.119
the investigating judge

00:15:47.431 --> 00:15:49.650
and the assistant prosecutor

00:15:50.246 --> 00:15:52.939
in moral matters,

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:57.500
so the file has been put aside until now.

00:15:58.297 --> 00:16:04.359
Various lawyers have published

00:16:04.906 --> 00:16:07.087
legal cases in Al-Manihla operation

00:16:07.857 --> 00:16:09.024
because

00:16:10.596 --> 00:16:12.675
the rotten political atmosphere

00:16:13.485 --> 00:16:15.611
and the ailing faltering judiciary

00:16:17.016 --> 00:16:22.929
left these files in desk drawers.

00:16:35.601 --> 00:16:37.103
I arrived here

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:39.909
in the French capital, Paris,

00:16:40.428 --> 00:16:42.959
in pursue to meet with security figures

00:16:43.301 --> 00:16:44.556
who left Tunisia

00:16:44.993 --> 00:16:48.694
and whose names were associated with
the recruitment of permeation members

00:16:48.948 --> 00:16:52.757
for the benefit of
Tunisian security agencies.

00:17:02.458 --> 00:17:05.219
Haykal Ad-Dakhil,
a former Tunisian security.

00:17:05.623 --> 00:17:08.576
He took refuge in France in 2017.

00:17:08.865 --> 00:17:13.595
The man was the head of the General Administration
of Prisons and Reform research team.

00:17:14.093 --> 00:17:17.775
He is the one who opened an investigation
into the terrorist operation in Manihla.

00:17:18.219 --> 00:17:19.167
Who supervised the investigation?

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:23.016
Yes, the one who supervised the investigation was
his assistant attorney general for terrorism cases.

00:17:23.425 --> 00:17:29.087
They recruited a girl for him; she was barely 18
or 19 and studying for the baccalaureate then.

00:17:29.299 --> 00:17:32.400
Regrettably, he was the assistant attorney
general at the time for terrorism cases,

00:17:32.534 --> 00:17:37.101
and he was the one who opened an investigation
into the fabricated Manihla operation.

00:17:37.387 --> 00:17:39.635
He also knew it was fabricated,

00:17:39.761 --> 00:17:44.008
yet, he initiated the necessary investigations and
asked for labour, and the police worked with him.

00:17:44.857 --> 00:17:46.952
I mean the competent
departments of the Ministry of Interior.

00:17:47.333 --> 00:17:50.341
And they got all the correct information.
They know everything I'm telling you now.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:53.714
Who are those involved
in Al-Manihla operation?

00:17:53.847 --> 00:17:56.330
Unfortunately, they are security
leaders affiliated with the National Guard.

00:17:56.489 --> 00:17:58.905
These people do not honour the state

00:17:59.092 --> 00:18:02.599
because they are drenched
in blood up to the neck.

00:18:03.568 --> 00:18:04.698
Al-Manihla operation:

00:18:05.099 --> 00:18:07.929
It took place in May 2016,

00:18:08.764 --> 00:18:11.286
when some units of the National Guard,

00:18:11.843 --> 00:18:13.484
led by Lotfi Brahem at the time,

00:18:13.571 --> 00:18:16.976
raided homes west of the Tunisian capital.

00:18:17.295 --> 00:18:19.056
For intelligence
information that was received

00:18:19.597 --> 00:18:23.167
about the presence of armed men
intending to carry out terrorist operations

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.548
inside Tunisia

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.794
According to a statement
of the Ministry of Interior,

00:18:27.418 --> 00:18:29.349
the Tunisian authorities
announced at the time

00:18:29.796 --> 00:18:32.698
that two gunmen were killed,
whom they described as dangerous,

00:18:33.272 --> 00:18:34.929
in addition to the arrest of others

00:18:35.373 --> 00:18:38.873
with the seizure of machine
guns, bombs and ammunition.

00:18:40.013 --> 00:18:44.325
But a lot of doubts surround
this proactive operation.

00:18:45.259 --> 00:18:47.674
As in this document we obtained,

00:18:48.119 --> 00:18:52.611
the commander concluded the investigation based on what
he described as imbalances in the official accounts.

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.952
Which came in the words of the
spokesman of the National Guard

00:18:56.637 --> 00:18:58.008
that Al-Manihla operation

00:18:58.581 --> 00:19:01.103
was a fabricated&nbsp;crime.

00:19:01.383 --> 00:19:03.930
This file is an absolute scandal

00:19:04.373 --> 00:19:05.992
for the security services

00:19:06.642 --> 00:19:11.024
that demonstrated the role of some parties

00:19:11.261 --> 00:19:12.565
in creating terrorism

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:16.177
instead of working to suppress these acts.

00:19:16.521 --> 00:19:18.563
Of course, there are political figures,

00:19:18.687 --> 00:19:26.015
as the security services only act
under cover from political parties,

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:29.389
who were working to return Tunisia

00:19:29.539 --> 00:19:32.730
to the tyranny period by
using the card of terrorism.

00:19:33.269 --> 00:19:36.792
- As for the group in Al-Manihla, was it all Tunisians?
- Yes.

00:19:37.253 --> 00:19:39.275
Were they all inside the country?

00:19:39.458 --> 00:19:43.585
Are their names known?
Are they openly linked to terrorist groups?

00:19:43.767 --> 00:19:47.119
One of the surprises that
accompanied Al-Manihla's operation

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:50.943
and confirmed the dangerous tampering
with the terrorism file in Tunisia

00:19:51.396 --> 00:19:54.773
was that one of those
arrested in Al-Manihla

00:19:54.868 --> 00:19:56.757
was the famous Adel Al-Ghandari.

00:19:57.352 --> 00:20:00.103
Who is one of the leaders of ISIS,

00:20:00.573 --> 00:20:04.579
whom the Tunisians thought and
various media channels announced

00:20:04.942 --> 00:20:06.802
the news of his arrest in Libya

00:20:06.984 --> 00:20:10.659
and his handover to the Tunisian
authorities at the border crossing

00:20:10.809 --> 00:20:12.785
two or three months before
the Al-Manihla operation.

00:20:13.094 --> 00:20:14.270
To the public surprise

00:20:14.983 --> 00:20:16.808
that the same Ministry of the Interior

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:21.762
is talking about the arrest of Adel
Al-Ghandari in Al-Manihla operation

00:20:21.982 --> 00:20:26.593
among a terrorist group that was planning to
target an American military man in Tunisia.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:31.613
This raises several questions
and causes a lot of suspicions.

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:34.381
Yet, unfortunately, no one dared,

00:20:34.866 --> 00:20:38.582
or perhaps no one could overcome

00:20:39.011 --> 00:20:44.159
the phobia that occurred to officials and
judges as everyone seemed to be afraid

00:20:44.365 --> 00:20:46.380
and did not want to go
through any further into this file.

00:20:47.738 --> 00:20:49.310
In this investigation, we reviewed

00:20:49.563 --> 00:20:53.499
the leaked records of the people
arrested testimonies in Al-Manihla case.

00:20:54.491 --> 00:20:56.079
It was noted in their testimonies

00:20:56.484 --> 00:20:58.166
the repetition of the title of An-Nimer

00:20:58.388 --> 00:21:02.467
when they gave information about the identity of the
person supervising their recruitment and movements

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:04.627
a mysterious figure

00:21:04.808 --> 00:21:07.355
whose real name was not
mentioned in the actual file.

00:21:08.317 --> 00:21:10.579
In Al-Manihla file, the
investigation judge stated

00:21:10.913 --> 00:21:11.921
that An-Nimr

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:14.254
had been assigned as a permeation member

00:21:14.777 --> 00:21:16.888
under the supervision of the
National Guard Department.

00:21:17.317 --> 00:21:20.492
As for An-Nimer, he is likely
the prime permeation member.

00:21:20.563 --> 00:21:26.037
An-Nimr is the one who carried out all the
operations associated with Al-Manihala operation.

00:21:26.219 --> 00:21:32.460
He also was the one
who collected the accused

00:21:32.937 --> 00:21:35.738
and transferred them to Tunis, the capital,

00:21:35.881 --> 00:21:38.317
where he rented places for&nbsp;them&nbsp;to&nbsp;live.

00:21:38.460 --> 00:21:41.382
Is An-Nimr a member of the National Guard?

00:21:41.501 --> 00:21:44.889
No! An-Nimr is a civilian

00:21:45.247 --> 00:21:49.227
who was previously tried in 2007-2008

00:21:49.346 --> 00:21:51.790
in a case of a terrorist nature.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:57.361
It seems he was recruited during that period
in prison by one of the security services

00:21:57.917 --> 00:22:00.797
and became known to them.
According to his testimony,

00:22:01.218 --> 00:22:06.186
he is in direct contact with
the leaders of ISIS abroad.

00:22:06.924 --> 00:22:12.190
They also endorsed him; he speaks
and acts in their name in Tunisia.

00:22:13.797 --> 00:22:17.270
The documents reveal that the
Tunisian National Guard administration

00:22:17.699 --> 00:22:21.501
deliberately concealed the roles that
An-Nimr during Al-Manihla's operation

00:22:21.826 --> 00:22:25.064
from the Public Prosecution Office, which
was legally responsible for directing him.

00:22:25.905 --> 00:22:27.326
The police report stated

00:22:27.722 --> 00:22:29.127
that An-Nimr could not be interrogated

00:22:29.642 --> 00:22:31.397
or determine his true identity.

00:22:31.905 --> 00:22:34.500
Therefore, he was not brought to trial.

00:22:35.801 --> 00:22:38.030
The operation was out of
the supervision of the judiciary,

00:22:38.181 --> 00:22:40.135
and permission to infiltrate

00:22:40.706 --> 00:22:45.257
this member was not obtained

00:22:45.384 --> 00:22:47.940
until the night of the execution
of Al-Manihla operation.

00:22:48.372 --> 00:22:52.579
That means subsequent
legal coverage of an illegal act.

00:22:52.951 --> 00:22:54.429
If these groups

00:22:54.538 --> 00:22:56.000
were actual terrorist groups

00:22:56.395 --> 00:23:00.228
and were preparing to
commit attacks in the capital,

00:23:00.514 --> 00:23:03.354
the man named An-Nimr would
have been the first accused.

00:23:03.442 --> 00:23:05.190
Because he was the one who gathered them,

00:23:05.504 --> 00:23:08.004
he was the one who rented houses for them

00:23:08.227 --> 00:23:09.341
and sheltered them.

00:23:09.666 --> 00:23:13.071
Yet, he is entirely
absent from the case file.

00:23:14.324 --> 00:23:17.220
The summary of the investigation
leaders in Al-Manihla case

00:23:17.601 --> 00:23:19.656
reveals another hidden side.

00:23:19.902 --> 00:23:23.497
The Kalashnikov weapon
that An-Nimr handed over

00:23:23.731 --> 00:23:26.496
to the group that was raided in Al-Manihla

00:23:26.845 --> 00:23:30.424
was, basically, a weapon previously
confiscated by the National Guard,

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:33.820
and it was handed over after
the needle was removed from it

00:23:34.178 --> 00:23:37.059
to the group before the
intervention squad arrived.

00:23:38.976 --> 00:23:41.491
The Kalashnikov they found
in Al-Manihla's operation

00:23:42.269 --> 00:23:44.497
was not used because this Kalashnikov

00:23:44.862 --> 00:23:47.814
was one of the weapons that were impounded

00:23:47.965 --> 00:23:51.627
among the weapons that we found in 2012.

00:23:52.891 --> 00:23:56.518
First, 2012, then plenty of weapons stores

00:23:57.105 --> 00:23:59.714
were inspected by the
military and security units.

00:23:59.738 --> 00:24:01.238
They were all secured,

00:24:01.454 --> 00:24:05.825
meaning that each weapon,
Kalashnikov, had a number registered with

00:24:06.295 --> 00:24:10.238
and recorded in a special booklet

00:24:10.898 --> 00:24:12.310
before it was taken to the store.

00:24:13.628 --> 00:24:16.810
The Kalashnikov that the terrorists
used in Al-Manihla's operation

00:24:16.929 --> 00:24:20.016
were the same weapon used
by the terrorists in Al-Manihla.

00:24:20.238 --> 00:24:21.531
So, this means it was in one of the stores?

00:24:21.777 --> 00:24:23.714
Yes, in one of the stores.
But how did this weapon come out?

00:24:23.984 --> 00:24:26.269
No one can get it out except
for a High-ranked commander,

00:24:26.404 --> 00:24:28.167
not a simple person working in security.

00:24:28.388 --> 00:24:31.135
Despite the ambiguity of An-Nimr's
identity in the official investigations

00:24:31.665 --> 00:24:33.079
yet, later, he

00:24:33.379 --> 00:24:36.746
initiated contact with one of those
we interviewed in this investigation,

00:24:36.926 --> 00:24:37.778
Maher Zaid.

00:24:38.179 --> 00:24:39.762
Who has been personally active

00:24:39.997 --> 00:24:42.246
in tracing what happened in Al-Manihla.

00:24:42.396 --> 00:24:43.421
Did you meet Al-Nimer in person?

00:24:43.563 --> 00:24:47.778
Yes, I met Al-Nimer. He
contacted me on social media.

00:24:48.238 --> 00:24:50.934
After I started talking about
this subject, he called me.

00:24:51.062 --> 00:24:52.181
On what date?

00:24:52.912 --> 00:24:54.595
In October 2016.

00:24:55.188 --> 00:24:57.546
Four months after the operation.

00:24:57.935 --> 00:25:01.054
He requested to meet me.

00:25:01.784 --> 00:25:03.744
So I gave him that opportunity

00:25:03.839 --> 00:25:06.230
after I took his word that
I would not be harmed.

00:25:06.959 --> 00:25:07.913
He admitted,

00:25:08.006 --> 00:25:11.730
during that meeting, that he had been
working with the security services for years.

00:25:12.078 --> 00:25:16.926
But, according to what he
said, he wanted to correct

00:25:17.338 --> 00:25:22.484
some of the information that was inaccurately
mentioned about himself and his role.

00:25:22.587 --> 00:25:23.746
Like what?

00:25:24.253 --> 00:25:28.308
For example, he seized
vast sums of money

00:25:28.673 --> 00:25:31.855
from the people he gathered.

00:25:32.838 --> 00:25:34.711
Of course, he did not
give me his real identity.

00:25:34.868 --> 00:25:40.965
I noticed that his mother called frequently
and was interrupting our conversation.

00:25:41.410 --> 00:25:43.543
He showed me the phone and
said, “Look! That's my mother.

00:25:43.718 --> 00:25:47.738
Due to being terrified of
the pressure I'm exposed to

00:25:47.995 --> 00:25:50.186
after my name has been leaked.

00:25:50.535 --> 00:25:54.087
Also, those who have been arrested and are
still in prison in Al-Manhila operation.

00:25:54.304 --> 00:25:58.145
They will definitely lead
counterparts and others to target me.”

00:25:59.779 --> 00:26:04.011
When we searched for the account that
An-Nimr used to communicate with Maher Zaid,

00:26:04.351 --> 00:26:08.287
we found out that the username had
been deleted and is no longer in use.

00:26:10.470 --> 00:26:14.422
In this investigation, we met the
Tunisian activist Al-Saheb Al-Omari,

00:26:14.787 --> 00:26:17.858
imprisoned due to political cases.

00:26:18.398 --> 00:26:21.817
This man reveals the
true identity of An-Nimr,

00:26:22.059 --> 00:26:25.083
based on information
he received inside prison.

00:26:25.503 --> 00:26:28.305
Someone originally from Ghardan

00:26:29.469 --> 00:26:33.077
told me about the
permeation inside the prison

00:26:34.055 --> 00:26:36.942
and wanted me to be cautious

00:26:38.190 --> 00:26:46.698
in mixing with dishonest people.

00:26:49.096 --> 00:26:53.873
Mainly that people felt
that there were permeations.

00:26:54.651 --> 00:26:58.695
One of them told me about
someone called An-Nimr.

00:27:00.886 --> 00:27:03.119
An-Nimr

00:27:06.072 --> 00:27:07.476
was imprisoned and infiltrated

00:27:09.440 --> 00:27:12.230
the Salafi Jihadi group.

00:27:14.669 --> 00:27:16.683
Yet, when he was released

00:27:17.224 --> 00:27:21.343
after serving his prison term,

00:27:21.653 --> 00:27:24.262
when he was leaving prison,

00:27:26.422 --> 00:27:33.952
he joined Salafist groups

00:27:34.867 --> 00:27:36.724
stationed in Sparta.

00:27:37.200 --> 00:27:40.565
His name is Khalil Al-Sidani.

00:27:41.509 --> 00:27:43.135
A resident of At-Tadamon neighborhood,

00:27:46.262 --> 00:27:47.857
and that he is a spy.

00:27:47.936 --> 00:27:52.388
He brought and recruited forty young men

00:27:52.531 --> 00:27:54.840
40 young men for the
operation of Al-Manihla.

00:27:57.800 --> 00:28:00.101
The records of the detainees in the case

00:28:00.439 --> 00:28:05.130
reveal the roles played by An-Nimr
in managing the group he recruited.

00:28:05.804 --> 00:28:07.698
One of the detainees says in his testimony

00:28:08.254 --> 00:28:11.050
that An-Nimr brought a weapon with him

00:28:11.460 --> 00:28:13.500
and gave lessons in assembly, disassembly

00:28:13.849 --> 00:28:15.214
and theoretical shooting

00:28:15.581 --> 00:28:17.469
to prepare the group members

00:28:17.557 --> 00:28:20.047
to carry out operations
on the Tunisian lands.

00:28:20.447 --> 00:28:23.912
According to the statement of
another detainee, the so-called An-Nimr

00:28:24.335 --> 00:28:28.563
suggested carrying out operations
to target the National Guard agents

00:28:29.015 --> 00:28:31.230
and the isolated security patrols.

00:28:31.420 --> 00:28:33.736
And the testimony of a third
detainee clarifies

00:28:34.049 --> 00:28:36.601
that one of the targets
identified by An-Nimr

00:28:36.791 --> 00:28:38.593
was an American general

00:28:38.721 --> 00:28:42.221
who frequently visited the
officers' club in Al-Hammamet area.

00:28:42.937 --> 00:28:46.841
So, what is the interest of
An-Nimr to define those targets?

00:28:48.253 --> 00:28:52.905
Tunisia is engaged in
combating international terrorism

00:28:54.136 --> 00:28:57.238
with American support; however,

00:28:58.206 --> 00:29:05.418
since the descent of the
pattern of terrorism in Tunisia,

00:29:05.877 --> 00:29:09.730
the grant did not exceed
forty million dinars.

00:29:11.325 --> 00:29:16.492
Mr (What is his name!)
Mr Lotfi Brahem agreed

00:29:17.825 --> 00:29:20.039
and formed a criminal alliance

00:29:22.349 --> 00:29:24.484
to pressure America

00:29:24.890 --> 00:29:28.072
to return the regular expenses

00:29:29.167 --> 00:29:32.206
that come in bags,

00:29:32.373 --> 00:29:33.944
bags of money.

00:29:35.706 --> 00:29:37.904
Why did it come in bags
and not throw bank transfers?

00:29:38.301 --> 00:29:41.738
Due to the privacy and
confidentiality of the mission.

00:29:42.206 --> 00:29:44.410
Fellow officers

00:29:45.730 --> 00:29:48.524
devised (and he was with them)

00:29:49.333 --> 00:29:51.992
a ploy to blackmail the United States

00:29:52.079 --> 00:29:54.158
into combating terrorism,

00:29:55.381 --> 00:29:59.878
and they started
fabricating terrorist incidents.

00:30:00.330 --> 00:30:04.274
Not only the operation of Manhila

00:30:05.647 --> 00:30:07.871
but other operations of
Sidi Bouzaid and others.

00:30:08.022 --> 00:30:10.903
Did he reveal to you the name
of the officer who recruited him?

00:30:11.315 --> 00:30:14.127
Yes, An-Nimr, is no
different than others like him,

00:30:14.362 --> 00:30:18.123
among the members of permeation
who were used for these missions,

00:30:18.758 --> 00:30:21.817
talked to us all through those years

00:30:22.322 --> 00:30:24.262
and all of them, without exception,

00:30:24.365 --> 00:30:28.921
were talking about a figure called
Al-Pasha, a person named Al-Pasha.

00:30:29.634 --> 00:30:31.062
Who is a senior officer in the Guard;

00:30:31.458 --> 00:30:35.243
he was in charge of managing these spies.

00:30:35.284 --> 00:30:38.778
He communicated with them and
gave them instructions and cash.

00:30:39.199 --> 00:30:42.691
Either for themselves or
to carry out some missions.

00:30:43.159 --> 00:30:45.230
Did he reveal to you the
actual name of Al-Pasha?

00:30:46.389 --> 00:30:49.427
No, he did not reveal the
actual name of Al-Pasha to me;

00:30:49.482 --> 00:30:50.943
he only gave me his number.

00:30:51.181 --> 00:30:55.569
It has been said that the one responsible
for creating the permeation members

00:30:56.085 --> 00:30:57.038
is Al-Pasha.

00:30:57.395 --> 00:30:58.863
- Yes, Al-Pasha.
- Who is Al-Pasha?

00:30:58.950 --> 00:31:01.338
Al-Pasha is a Brigadier General
in the Guard named Khaled Hanish.

00:31:01.450 --> 00:31:02.973
- Do you know him personally?
- Yes, I know him.

00:31:03.346 --> 00:31:05.095
I will tell you how I knew him personally.

00:31:05.354 --> 00:31:09.849
I went to the research group one day.

00:31:10.770 --> 00:31:11.778
I went and met him.

00:31:12.690 --> 00:31:15.762
We talked about several things; then
he asked me: Do you know An-Nimr?

00:31:15.849 --> 00:31:16.857
I told him: Yes, I know An-Nimr.

00:31:18.394 --> 00:31:21.190
Then I showed him the conversation
between him and me on my phone.

00:31:21.313 --> 00:31:21.900
The conversation?

00:31:22.043 --> 00:31:25.098
Yes, the conversation. Because he knows that I am a man of
security following instructions and I have nothing to worry about.

00:31:25.432 --> 00:31:27.833
I told him: do you know that
An-Nimr knows Maher Zaid?

00:31:28.373 --> 00:31:31.626
And here was the catastrophe
and surprise, my friend.

00:31:32.611 --> 00:31:34.984
- I saw the man's face...
- Changed!

00:31:35.040 --> 00:31:36.627
It became yellow.

00:31:37.006 --> 00:31:40.873
He said: Maher Zaid?
I told him: Yes, Maher Zaid knows An-Nimr,

00:31:41.126 --> 00:31:42.530
and they met in At-Tadamon neighbourhood.

00:31:43.991 --> 00:31:47.929
So he went out to make a phone
call and returned after five minutes.

00:31:48.332 --> 00:31:49.635
He said: Haykal, come with me to Owainat.

00:31:49.982 --> 00:31:54.062
I told myself: that's exactly what I
want; I want to know this beehive

00:31:54.100 --> 00:31:56.912
that is causing the natural
disasters in Tunisia, and who they are.

00:31:57.579 --> 00:32:01.158
The Pasha is the Brigade General,
Khaled Hniche.

00:32:02.713 --> 00:32:05.611
He is an agent for foreign intelligence

00:32:07.063 --> 00:32:09.507
and they pay him a fortune

00:32:10.339 --> 00:32:12.357
within the framework of
International Cooperation.

00:32:13.410 --> 00:32:17.449
His job is to choose permeation agents.

00:32:18.830 --> 00:32:20.913
An-Nimr is one of them;

00:32:21.830 --> 00:32:23.992
by no means can An-Nimr be the only one.

00:32:25.603 --> 00:32:26.611
In this investigation,

00:32:27.026 --> 00:32:28.772
we obtained confidential testimony

00:32:29.169 --> 00:32:32.571
from a spy who the Tunisian
Security Forces recruited.

00:32:33.065 --> 00:32:34.992
According to this man, he has been assigned

00:32:35.119 --> 00:32:37.834
to transport money, and
the wanted armed men

00:32:38.096 --> 00:32:40.842
between Libya and the
Tunisian mountains at the border.

00:32:41.326 --> 00:32:43.683
Now, I have been
officially assigned a mission.

00:32:44.032 --> 00:32:45.476
I created an account on Telegram

00:32:45.793 --> 00:32:49.048
to contact Mr At-Taher Al-Gharbi in Libya,

00:32:49.261 --> 00:32:51.618
accompanied by Bachindi in the mountains.

00:32:52.341 --> 00:32:55.349
So, I went to Libya

00:32:55.825 --> 00:32:58.810
and called Mr At-Taher Al-Gharbi,

00:32:59.397 --> 00:33:01.627
and agreed to the operation terms.

00:33:01.906 --> 00:33:08.087
I get 1500 dinars for every wanted
person I deliver to Bin Gardane

00:33:08.499 --> 00:33:11.984
and 1000 dinars for every unwanted person

00:33:12.380 --> 00:33:15.289
as they have people in Bin
Gardane to complete the mission.

00:33:18.771 --> 00:33:21.595
We sought more information

00:33:21.905 --> 00:33:25.889
about more permeative spies
recruited by the National Guards.

00:33:26.937 --> 00:33:30.430
Zeinab Kachroud, a Tunisian recruited

00:33:30.708 --> 00:33:33.405
to deliver money to the
armed groups in the mountains

00:33:33.914 --> 00:33:36.048
on the Tunisian Algerian borders.

00:33:36.564 --> 00:33:40.603
Yet, during one of her missions, she got
arrested by the Algerian Security Forces.

00:33:41.213 --> 00:33:43.625
We were able to get
a letter written by her.

00:33:43.740 --> 00:33:45.767
From her jail in Algeria,

00:33:46.128 --> 00:33:48.951
she wrote it in March 2019.

00:33:49.271 --> 00:33:52.825
She addressed the letter to the Public
Persecutor for combating terrorism in Tunisia,

00:33:53.342 --> 00:33:56.254
imploring him to admit that she
was on a mission assigned to her

00:33:56.389 --> 00:33:58.984
to infiltrate the terrorist groups.

00:34:00.222 --> 00:34:04.576
Sir, I do not want to seek help
from Algeria to get my rights

00:34:05.050 --> 00:34:07.698
but instead ask you, the
Tunisian Republic, my country,

00:34:08.086 --> 00:34:10.023
to interfere and get my right.

00:34:10.404 --> 00:34:13.642
As I haven't forgotten
the day I was recruited

00:34:13.792 --> 00:34:16.294
and the promise you made back then

00:34:16.704 --> 00:34:18.815
that I shall not be harmed.

00:34:18.827 --> 00:34:21.826
I hope you will take responsibility

00:34:22.040 --> 00:34:26.421
because I am still under your legal and
humanitarian obligation,

00:34:26.838 --> 00:34:28.607
and despite all I have been through,

00:34:28.853 --> 00:34:31.520
I still fully trust you.

00:34:32.924 --> 00:34:35.701
She is one girl among many others

00:34:35.844 --> 00:34:40.177
recruited to infiltrate
the terrorist groups

00:34:41.082 --> 00:34:43.111
and was asked at some point

00:34:43.645 --> 00:34:47.322
- by the same officer supervising all missions.
- Al-Pasha.

00:34:47.576 --> 00:34:49.682
Yes, and this orientation operation.

00:34:50.206 --> 00:34:55.118
He sent the girl to the border
between Tunisia and Algeria,

00:34:55.420 --> 00:34:58.307
where dozens of armed men hid out.

00:34:58.778 --> 00:35:04.534
Equally divided between Tunisians and Algerians
and some individuals from other nationalities.

00:35:05.023 --> 00:35:09.373
She was arrested on Algerian territories,

00:35:09.788 --> 00:35:11.478
and she was presented to the court.

00:35:12.460 --> 00:35:14.444
The persecutor was shocked.

00:35:14.558 --> 00:35:15.463
The Algerian?

00:35:15.647 --> 00:35:19.891
The Chief Algerian Persecutor at
the Court of Bab El Wadi, Algiers.

00:35:20.383 --> 00:35:25.875
He was shocked that the
"terrorist" before him told him:

00:35:25.983 --> 00:35:30.709
I am a patriot working for
my own country assigned

00:35:31.058 --> 00:35:36.348
by the National security forces to
infiltrate those armed men in the mountains.

00:35:36.841 --> 00:35:41.595
So, he allowed her to communicate with
the security office that had assigned her.

00:35:42.402 --> 00:35:46.178
But, unfortunately, that security office
forsaken and denied any relation to her.

00:35:46.670 --> 00:35:50.439
So, she spent five whole
years in jail in Algeria

00:35:50.900 --> 00:35:53.804
after being charged with being
a member of a terrorist group.

00:35:54.003 --> 00:35:57.558
I have been humiliated and threatened to be
killed.

00:35:57.810 --> 00:36:01.687
Neither did the state compensate me nor
give me a job.

00:36:01.814 --> 00:36:05.286
I am not asking for money but for
their protection. I don't need the money.

00:36:05.627 --> 00:36:08.222
Help me get out of Tunisia. I
do not want to live here any more.

00:36:08.647 --> 00:36:10.498
My country will remain
even if it mistreats me,

00:36:10.651 --> 00:36:15.655
but I cannot live between death threats by
armed groups and the state's negligence.

00:36:15.829 --> 00:36:18.413
I have served the Tunisia State,
and for that, it must protect me.

00:36:18.699 --> 00:36:22.778
Regarding An-Nimr, is he still in Tunisia?

00:36:23.040 --> 00:36:24.825
Yes, An-Nimr is still in Tunisia.

00:36:25.460 --> 00:36:26.658
As a free man?

00:36:26.983 --> 00:36:28.367
He has the absolute freedom
to move anywhere.

00:36:28.571 --> 00:36:31.932
After the exculpation of all of them

00:36:32.369 --> 00:36:34.351
and confidence that what
had happened was a mere play

00:36:34.708 --> 00:36:38.745
and after the National Guards
were killed and martyrised.

00:36:38.832 --> 00:36:42.593
Until today, all those
involved in this crime are free,

00:36:42.927 --> 00:36:45.009
as it is the case with all other crimes.

00:36:47.917 --> 00:36:51.121
Another armed attack in
the heart of Tunis, the capital.

00:36:51.708 --> 00:36:54.240
Two armed men attacked the Bardo Museum,

00:36:54.810 --> 00:36:56.556
near the Tunisian Parliament,

00:36:57.055 --> 00:36:59.816
in March 2015.

00:37:00.451 --> 00:37:04.032
It ended with killing more than 20
people, most of whom were tourists,

00:37:04.300 --> 00:37:06.387
and injuring about 50 others.

00:37:11.089 --> 00:37:13.295
Security forces immediately intervened

00:37:13.509 --> 00:37:18.603
and announced later, arresting those
involved in the attack.

00:37:20.469 --> 00:37:22.587
The Persecutor's report on the Bardo attack
mentioned:

00:37:23.023 --> 00:37:25.183
that a wide falsification of the incidents

00:37:25.603 --> 00:37:29.166
was due to confessions under torture.

00:37:34.390 --> 00:37:38.231
Philippe De Veulle, one of the lawyers
representing the victims of the Bardo attack,

00:37:38.739 --> 00:37:41.831
whose investigations are still ongoing
as this report is being broadcasted.

00:37:42.442 --> 00:37:45.118
Mr Philippe, you were among the lawyers

00:37:45.237 --> 00:37:48.500
representing the French
victims of the Bardo attack.

00:37:49.117 --> 00:37:54.070
What are the most significant faults and
loopholes, in this case, Mr Philippe?

00:37:55.186 --> 00:38:00.106
Well, at the first stage of this case,

00:38:00.205 --> 00:38:03.130
I was surprised to learn of the
absence of security in the Bardo Museum,

00:38:03.265 --> 00:38:05.757
and that was the first
thing I publicly denounced.

00:38:07.018 --> 00:38:10.184
O my God! How can a country like Tunisia

00:38:10.422 --> 00:38:16.377
depend on only two unarmed security
guards to protect Bardo Museum

00:38:16.579 --> 00:38:21.761
among all the security threats
in the region at that time?

00:38:21.983 --> 00:38:28.015
To me, that was the first fault
from the side of the Tunisian State.

00:38:30.634 --> 00:38:32.749
Tunisian media reported on

00:38:33.122 --> 00:38:36.556
a security document directed to
the Head of National Security

00:38:36.960 --> 00:38:39.984
requesting him to secure the
area around the Bardo Museum

00:38:40.262 --> 00:38:42.853
about ten days before the attack,

00:38:43.127 --> 00:38:44.984
based on confirmed information

00:38:45.266 --> 00:38:48.980
that armed groups are
planning to attack the site,

00:38:49.313 --> 00:38:50.571
according to the document.

00:38:50.981 --> 00:38:55.497
Afterwards, the Tunisian Ministry of
Interior rushed to deny this document.

00:38:55.949 --> 00:38:58.554
However, this raised many questions

00:38:58.959 --> 00:39:05.018
about the backstage of the
armed attacks nationwide.

00:39:05.566 --> 00:39:08.717
Have you found ties
between the Tunisian State

00:39:08.773 --> 00:39:11.805
and its security forces
to the Bardo attack?

00:39:12.328 --> 00:39:17.886
With time we find out more and more
that it was an obvious lack of security,

00:39:18.663 --> 00:39:22.643
but, in fact, it may also
have to do with something

00:39:22.939 --> 00:39:26.130
that had been preplanned
by a secret organisation

00:39:26.257 --> 00:39:28.670
of the Tunisian State at that time.

00:39:28.979 --> 00:39:32.336
I have no evidence to prove this,

00:39:32.725 --> 00:39:37.740
but this is actually something
that we can think about.

00:39:38.336 --> 00:39:40.389
The same team was working,

00:39:40.658 --> 00:39:43.025
and not only did the permeation
take place by

00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:45.222
those directly working with Lotfi Brahem

00:39:45.510 --> 00:39:50.295
but also by corrupt officials, spies
and affiliates to foreign powers

00:39:50.579 --> 00:39:52.000
working in the security forces,

00:39:52.130 --> 00:39:54.175
were also conducting the same methods.

00:39:55.921 --> 00:39:56.714
Lotfi Brahem

00:39:57.183 --> 00:40:00.500
was named the head of
the National Guards in 2015

00:40:00.968 --> 00:40:04.929
at the time when the terrorist
attacks peaked all over the country.

00:40:05.282 --> 00:40:11.988
We are here to fight terrorism. We discover
armed cells every day all over the country.

00:40:13.008 --> 00:40:15.401
Among many, we found in this document

00:40:15.695 --> 00:40:20.523
that the persecutor
assigned to the Mnihla Case

00:40:20.896 --> 00:40:23.746
clearly states that Lotfi Brahem,
the head of the National Guards,

00:40:24.309 --> 00:40:26.873
directly interfered with covering
up the breaches in this case.

00:40:27.447 --> 00:40:29.693
Mr Lofti Brahem, Minister of Interior.

00:40:29.923 --> 00:40:35.200
Lotfi Brahem was assigned to be the Minister
of Interior by PM Youssef Chahed in 2017.

00:40:35.477 --> 00:40:36.977
... and to protect its interests.

00:40:42.849 --> 00:40:45.190
The French writer and
journalist Nicolas Beau,

00:40:45.632 --> 00:40:50.066
the expert on Tunisian affairs,
had revealed in many of his articles

00:40:50.375 --> 00:40:53.891
multiple secrets of the politicians
and security officials in Tunisia

00:40:54.113 --> 00:40:56.378
for decades.

00:40:57.711 --> 00:41:00.160
Within the last few years, his
name was often associated with

00:41:00.438 --> 00:41:02.287
revealing a classified document

00:41:02.612 --> 00:41:07.452
on Lotfi Brahem's controversial
role in an attempted coup.

00:41:07.659 --> 00:41:11.698
The thing that made
Brahem sue Nicolas Beau.

00:41:13.229 --> 00:41:16.914
Mr Nicolas, you had mentioned
a leaked, classified document

00:41:17.294 --> 00:41:21.432
on the time when Lotfi Brahem was
head of the Tunisian National Guards.

00:41:22.063 --> 00:41:24.700
This document proves as
you said, his preparations

00:41:25.017 --> 00:41:28.168
to divert the political route in Tunisia.

00:41:28.976 --> 00:41:29.992
What document is that?

00:41:30.730 --> 00:41:32.302
And what does is exactly state?

00:41:33.659 --> 00:41:39.916
We saw in this document that
it had been proven afterwards

00:41:40.441 --> 00:41:48.970
that Lotfi Brahem has founded
many strong bonds with politicians,

00:41:49.708 --> 00:41:55.213
He had strong ties in
various Tunisian governorates

00:41:55.882 --> 00:42:02.312
with members of the National Guards
involved in smuggling across the borders.

00:42:05.217 --> 00:42:09.430
Many people succeeded
in gaining his loyalty,

00:42:10.090 --> 00:42:14.083
politicians, security forces
and even business people.

00:42:16.287 --> 00:42:19.922
He was evidently ambitious.

00:42:23.159 --> 00:42:25.413
Mid-2018,

00:42:25.818 --> 00:42:27.667
Lotfi Brahem was dismissed

00:42:27.921 --> 00:42:30.192
during the rule of former
president Beji Caid Essebsi

00:42:30.484 --> 00:42:33.984
after reports of him attempting a coup.

00:42:35.562 --> 00:42:39.062
Remarkably, days after Brahem's
dismissal from the Ministry of Interior,

00:42:39.405 --> 00:42:43.898
an armed attack targeted
members of the National Guards.

00:42:44.190 --> 00:42:49.397
and killed six of them in the Jendouba
Governorate, bordering Algeria.

00:42:50.797 --> 00:42:53.289
There are two hypotheses:

00:42:53.651 --> 00:42:58.584
The first is that the National
Guards were weakened

00:42:58.849 --> 00:43:00.905
by dismissing its leaders

00:43:01.413 --> 00:43:05.532
and that the terrorist
groups took advantage of that

00:43:05.824 --> 00:43:10.830
to kill six of the National
Guards in the heart of Tunisia.

00:43:11.491 --> 00:43:17.324
The hypothesis that many
newspapers in Tunisia supported.

00:43:17.738 --> 00:43:19.723
There is another hypothesis:

00:43:20.162 --> 00:43:22.548
states that Lotfi Brahem

00:43:22.913 --> 00:43:29.126
in order to show that his presence and his assistants
are crucial to maintaining security in Tunisia,

00:43:29.499 --> 00:43:35.907
is why he arranged this terrorist
attack. And that would be very easy to do.

00:43:36.941 --> 00:43:41.000
Once again, Lotfi Brahem's
name was popular in the media

00:43:41.352 --> 00:43:45.480
to come to power again as the Minister of Interior
in the current government of President Kais Saied.

00:43:45.825 --> 00:43:51.830
Today, Lotfi Brahem is
roaming in the same spots

00:43:52.135 --> 00:43:54.354
where people close to
Kais Saied are located.

00:43:54.873 --> 00:43:59.363
He was strongly nominated to
become the Minister of Interior,

00:43:59.704 --> 00:44:04.649
and until today, he advises Kais
Saied's team with his experience.

00:44:06.690 --> 00:44:10.668
During this investigation, we
tried to contact Lotfi Brahem

00:44:10.954 --> 00:44:14.762
to answer our inquiries and respond
to the accusations in this investigation.

00:44:15.556 --> 00:44:19.143
The number you are calling
is currently unavailable.

00:44:19.563 --> 00:44:21.857
Please leave a message after the tone

00:44:22.143 --> 00:44:24.822
or try to call again later.

00:44:39.299 --> 00:44:42.060
Mr Maher, you mentioned an organisation

00:44:42.290 --> 00:44:44.282
directing these incidents.

00:44:45.254 --> 00:44:46.987
Who are the members of this organisation?

00:44:47.365 --> 00:44:49.347
The head of this organisation is abroad.

00:44:49.696 --> 00:44:52.635
They were significantly affected
by the Arab Spring of 2011

00:44:53.040 --> 00:44:58.730
and were afraid to catch the
"infection" in their own countries.

00:44:59.008 --> 00:45:04.465
Of course, the classical
enemy, the French institutions

00:45:04.714 --> 00:45:08.196
that are in direct contact with them

00:45:08.437 --> 00:45:13.332
and they never spare a chance to
shamelessly and fully defend France

00:45:13.464 --> 00:45:14.810
 they defend its interests.

00:45:15.020 --> 00:45:19.093
When you accuse the French State
of conspiring with the Tunisian State,

00:45:19.540 --> 00:45:21.532
in an operation like Bardo, for instance.

00:45:21.913 --> 00:45:22.848
What do you mean?

00:45:23.016 --> 00:45:25.402
Do you mean a conspiracy
on the intelligence level?

00:45:26.333 --> 00:45:29.786
Or do you mean that the
French State has evidence of

00:45:30.071 --> 00:45:33.524
its friends in Tunisia being involved in
those attacks?

00:45:34.286 --> 00:45:37.651
It is a question I still have in my mind.

00:45:38.024 --> 00:45:40.508
One thing is quite apparent.

00:45:40.659 --> 00:45:43.399
When I accused the Tunisian judge.

00:45:43.945 --> 00:45:49.193
At that time, the French Judge,
Isabelle Cosie surprised us all.

00:45:49.460 --> 00:45:50.468
All of us,

00:45:50.548 --> 00:45:51.556
not only me

00:45:51.913 --> 00:45:53.794
and told all the victims:

00:45:54.937 --> 00:45:59.084
Please do not touch Tunisia.

00:45:59.373 --> 00:46:01.198
It seems like a no-go zone.

00:46:01.857 --> 00:46:05.032
It is best not to accuse
the Tunisian State.

00:46:06.198 --> 00:46:07.540
I was totally shocked.

00:46:09.135 --> 00:46:11.659
When I spoke to President Hollande,

00:46:11.984 --> 00:46:14.819
I was confident that he
would understand that.

00:46:15.264 --> 00:46:16.970
He did listen to me.

00:46:17.762 --> 00:46:23.448
But the question is: why hasn't
he done anything to help us?

00:46:23.718 --> 00:46:25.389
Have you found any explanation for that?

00:46:26.500 --> 00:46:30.091
Well, perhaps you should
ask President Hollande about it

00:46:30.401 --> 00:46:33.333
or ask Macron about his silence about it.

00:46:37.008 --> 00:46:39.457
Seven years have passed
since the Mnihla operation.

00:46:39.791 --> 00:46:43.690
No generals or officials
accused of planning it were sued,

00:46:44.056 --> 00:46:46.046
as per the leaked documents.

00:46:46.271 --> 00:46:49.247
Another eight years after
the Bardo Museum Attack,

00:46:49.595 --> 00:46:53.364
the Tunisian Judicial System has not yet ruled,
until the broadcast of this investigation,

00:46:53.860 --> 00:46:56.741
and many other cases are still pending.

00:46:57.469 --> 00:47:02.736
As the names and professions of the State
officials connected to those cases vary,

00:47:03.180 --> 00:47:06.729
the talk starts again about
the existence of the deep State

00:47:06.997 --> 00:47:08.767
that rules the scene nowadays in Tunisia.

00:47:09.069 --> 00:47:11.156
A state that the judicial system cannot
approach nor can be held accountable.

00:47:11.561 --> 00:47:16.115
The Deep State seeks to cover
up some of the political bodies

00:47:16.432 --> 00:47:19.781
involved in those breaches

00:47:20.059 --> 00:47:26.639
and reinvent terrorism and provocate it.

00:47:27.103 --> 00:47:29.008
There is no other explanation.

00:47:30.164 --> 00:47:33.048
And those involved in those breaches

00:47:33.389 --> 00:47:37.881
are all enjoying immunity today

00:47:38.157 --> 00:47:39.437
or, in other words, not being punished,

00:47:39.730 --> 00:47:42.811
and the law has not been enforced.

00:47:44.584 --> 00:47:48.236
There is no doubt that
the Deep State controls

00:47:48.554 --> 00:47:50.280
every aspect of the Tunisian State,

00:47:51.081 --> 00:47:55.409
the judicial system, the security forces,

00:47:55.774 --> 00:47:58.298
and even the political power.

00:48:00.460 --> 00:48:04.518
It does not want to let the
Tunisian people enjoy any freedom.

00:48:04.780 --> 00:48:11.700
It wants to hinder the Tunisians on their
way to freedom, democracy and development.

00:48:12.048 --> 00:48:17.396
It is the main hindrance to realise
the goals of the Tunisian Revolution.

00:48:19.990 --> 00:48:24.130
What is the organisation
that rules Tunisia nowadays?

00:48:24.416 --> 00:48:29.257
In consideration of the talk about a
Deep State controlling all aspects?

00:48:29.865 --> 00:48:31.798
Yes, exactly.

00:48:32.108 --> 00:48:33.965
I believe that it is an organisation.

00:48:34.219 --> 00:48:38.370
On the geographical level,
they belong to the Tunisian shore,

00:48:38.664 --> 00:48:42.514
the region that was always in control
of the political system in Tunisia.

00:48:42.911 --> 00:48:46.879
The people of the shore normally support
each other,

00:48:47.149 --> 00:48:49.855
undoubtfully aiming to reinstall the power

00:48:50.109 --> 00:48:53.227
that remained for an
extended period in their hands

00:48:53.500 --> 00:48:56.341
during the eras of Bourguiba and Ben Ali.

00:48:56.793 --> 00:49:00.550
That they lost in 2011.

00:49:00.901 --> 00:49:03.242
I believe that General Ben Ali,

00:49:03.512 --> 00:49:06.627
who had ruled for 17 years,

00:49:06.853 --> 00:49:14.087
succeeded in one important thing:
he established a strong police state.

00:49:14.365 --> 00:49:18.076
He succeeded in that because
the Tunisian army was weak.

00:49:18.306 --> 00:49:21.471
The president used
to control all the powers

00:49:21.677 --> 00:49:25.125
which the Ministry of Interior controlled

00:49:25.330 --> 00:49:31.418
and has indeed established what we
call the Deep State or the Police State.

00:49:31.682 --> 00:49:38.537
Kais Saied, just like Ben Ali, is
relying on this Police Organisation

00:49:38.849 --> 00:49:41.271
and this Deep State.

00:49:41.533 --> 00:49:43.335
Now that he is the head of
state, why doesn't he take action?

00:49:43.573 --> 00:49:44.786
He cannot. Why?

00:49:44.992 --> 00:49:46.389
Because he cannot take any single action.

00:49:46.667 --> 00:49:48.824
These documents are classified
and will remain classified forever.

00:49:49.078 --> 00:49:51.705
These documents shall
always remain classified.

00:49:53.146 --> 00:49:58.205
You were in the parliament when Ennahda Movement
was part of the ruling power in Tunisia.

00:49:58.661 --> 00:50:01.346
Why were you silent about this topic

00:50:01.754 --> 00:50:03.746
at a time when you were
able to do something about it?

00:50:04.052 --> 00:50:10.569
I think that Ennahda Movement
avoided dealing with those people

00:50:10.989 --> 00:50:12.837
because it knew very well, which is true,

00:50:13.052 --> 00:50:17.754
that many political powers had their back

00:50:20.603 --> 00:50:23.190
and created allies and full coordination

00:50:23.397 --> 00:50:26.189
to govern the country for ten years.

00:50:26.891 --> 00:50:32.262
So it avoided every possible chance to
force any serious and correct investigation

00:50:32.508 --> 00:50:35.377
into such crimes.

00:50:35.758 --> 00:50:39.631
Today, if we look back, they
have paid a very high price.

00:50:40.187 --> 00:50:42.709
Have they made a wrong
decision and this vision?

00:50:43.058 --> 00:50:48.153
Yes, our friends in Ennahda Movement,
in closed discussions, admit that

00:50:48.463 --> 00:50:51.099
all the terrorist attacks
were aimed against them

00:50:51.289 --> 00:50:53.714
and the whole Tunisian
democratic route in general

00:50:53.956 --> 00:50:56.667
and specific humane values,

00:50:56.937 --> 00:51:01.639
but they were not on the
required level of courage.

00:51:01.893 --> 00:51:08.202
They thought that the ties and alignments
they had created with political parties,

00:51:08.508 --> 00:51:11.581
as per their best thought at that time,

00:51:11.867 --> 00:51:16.184
that being allies with them is better
than facing them in judicial battles,

00:51:16.494 --> 00:51:20.883
which has led to all that
has happened on 25/07/2021.

00:51:26.915 --> 00:51:31.507
A security and political organisation
is controlling the scene in Tunisia.

00:51:32.103 --> 00:51:34.507
The political route was
diverted and changed,

00:51:34.972 --> 00:51:38.776
but this organisation has effectively
maintained its control over the whole scene.

00:51:39.278 --> 00:51:44.129
Backstage, many security
incidents of the last decade

00:51:44.486 --> 00:51:48.585
were only scenarios and
conspiracies to settle internal matters

00:51:48.934 --> 00:51:51.902
and to realise a cross-border agenda

00:51:52.889 --> 00:51:54.962
and that's only the Tip of the Iceberg.

